---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ContactButton from '../components/ContactButton.astro';
---

<Layout title="Consultation | Chef Gurbaj">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mb-8 border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 pb-6">
      Culinary <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#b38b1d] via-[#f8e192] to-[#b38b1d] dark:from-[#d4af37] dark:via-[#f8e192] dark:to-[#d4af37] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent italic animate-gradient-wave">Consultation</span>
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-12">
      <div class="prose dark:prose-invert prose-p:text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey prose-headings:text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white max-w-none lg:w-2/3">
        <p class="text-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-12">
          Building a successful restaurant goes far beyond a good recipe. It requires meticulous kitchen design, strategic menu engineering, precise food cost management, and a highly trained team. My consultation services are designed to build brands that scale.
        </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mb-4">Menu Engineering</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">
            Analyzing profitability, developing custom menus that align with your brand, and standardizing production recipes for absolute consistency.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mb-4">Kitchen Architecture</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">
            Redesigning kitchen stations and equipment placement to dramatically increase workflow productivity and daily output.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mb-4">Cost Control</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">
            Implementing food cost and waste reduction initiatives, auditing vendors, and establishing tight inventory controls.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 p-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-saffron-gold mb-4">Staff Training</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey">
            Training and mentoring staff in kitchen safety, sanitation, cooking techniques, and seamless dining experience execution.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-24 mb-16 border-t border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/20 pt-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mb-6">
          The <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#b38b1d] via-[#f8e192] to-[#b38b1d] dark:from-[#d4af37] dark:via-[#f8e192] dark:to-[#d4af37] bg-[length:200%_auto] bg-clip-text text-transparent italic animate-gradient-wave">Process</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl font-light leading-relaxed mb-16">
          Transparency and structure are the foundations of a successful culinary project. This is the exact blueprint we follow to take your restaurant from an initial concept to a highly-profitable, fully operational brand.
        </p>

        <div class="relative border-l border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-grey/30 pl-8 md:pl-12 space-y-16 mb-20">
          
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-12 md:-left-16 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black text-saffron-gold border border-saffron-gold rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold">1</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mt-0 mb-3">Discovery & Vision Alignment</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey m-0">
              We begin with a deep dive into your vision, target audience, and business goals. Whether we are auditing an existing operation or building a new brand, we establish clear KPIs and a concrete roadmap.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <div class="relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-12 md:-left-16 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black text-saffron-gold border border-saffron-gold rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold">2</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mt-0 mb-3">Menu Engineering & Kitchen Architecture</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey m-0">
              Based on the brand identity, we curate the menu, source premium ingredients, and design the kitchen layout to maximize workflow efficiency and minimize prep time.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <div class="relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-12 md:-left-16 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black text-saffron-gold border border-saffron-gold rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold">3</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mt-0 mb-3">Cost Analysis & Vendor Setup</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey m-0">
              We establish tight food cost controls and leverage my network to secure the best vendor suppliers, ensuring profitability from day one without compromising on quality.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 4 -->
          <div class="relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-12 md:-left-16 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black text-saffron-gold border border-saffron-gold rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold">4</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mt-0 mb-3">Staff Training & Mock Service</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey m-0">
              The backbone of any restaurant is its staff. We conduct rigorous BOH training in sanitation, safety, and plating, followed by dry runs and mock services to ensure flawless execution.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 5 -->
          <div class="relative">
            <span class="absolute -left-12 md:-left-16 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-obsidian-black text-saffron-gold border border-saffron-gold rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center font-heading font-bold">5</span>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mt-0 mb-3">Launch & Ongoing Audit</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey m-0">
              We oversee the launch to handle the high-volume pressure. Post-launch, we conduct performance reviews and food spoilage prevention checks to maintain stellar business reputation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-saffron-gold/10 to-transparent border-l-4 border-saffron-gold p-8 reveal">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading text-obsidian-black dark:text-pristine-white mb-4 mt-0">Ready to build a brand that scales?</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-grey mb-8">
          Whether you are launching a new concept or looking to optimize an existing operation, we can architect the perfect solution.
        </p>
        <ContactButton intent="consultation" text="Book a Consultation" />
      </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cinematic Image Side Panel -->
      <div class="hidden lg:block lg:w-1/3">
        <div class="sticky top-24 reveal delay-100">
          <div class="relative overflow-hidden elite-glass rounded-sm shadow-2xl p-2">
            <img src="/images/luxury_dining_room_1785772100116.jpg" alt="Luxury Dining Room" class="w-full h-[600px] object-cover rounded-sm grayscale dark:grayscale-0" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-obsidian-black/90 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6">
              <p class="text-saffron-gold font-heading text-xl italic m-0">"Design the experience."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
